@startuml
' NewEra POS - System sequence diagram of UC4 Start Up and Close session (main scenario and main variants), W09
' Team D - editable source of assets/ssd_uc4.png
' Render with: java -jar plantuml.jar -tpng assets/ssd_uc4.puml
' Step numbers refer to UC4 and to section 3.2.4.1 (Close session) in docs/requirements/SRS.md (W09).

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #444444
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF1FB
skinparam ActorBorderColor #444444
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F4F8FD
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam SequenceDividerBackgroundColor #EAF1FB
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B8A04A
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title NewEra POS - System sequence diagram: UC4 Start Up (with Close session)

actor ":Cashier" as Cashier
participant ":NewEra POS" as POS <<system>>

note over Cashier, POS
  Precondition: the register is switched on and no cashier session is open.
  The HR System and the Accounting System are inside the black box.
end note

== Start the POS (UC4 steps 1-4) ==
Cashier -> POS : startUp()
activate POS
POS --> Cashier : login screen with the register ID
deactivate POS
note right of POS
  The POS checks that the product catalog and the stored data are available
  (2a: error, no login screen) and sends the records waiting for the
  Accounting System in their original order (3). If the Accounting System
  does not answer, the records stay in the queue (3a, 3b).
end note

== Log in (steps 5-7) ==
Cashier -> POS : logIn(employeeID, pin)
activate POS
alt valid, active cashier and correct PIN
  POS --> Cashier : name of the cashier; asks for the opening cash
else employee not found or not an active cashier (6a)
  POS --> Cashier : "Employee ID not found or not an active cashier"
else wrong PIN (6b)
  POS --> Cashier : error; the Cashier enters the PIN again
else HR System not available (6c)
  POS --> Cashier : warning with the date of the local employee list;\nID and PIN checked against the local copy (salted hash)
end
deactivate POS
note right of POS
  Without a local employee list (6c2) the register cannot be
  started for sales. The PIN is never shown, logged or stored in plain text.
end note

== Open the session (steps 8-10) ==
Cashier -> POS : enterOpeningCash(amount)
activate POS
alt amount valid
  POS --> Cashier : cashier session opened; main screen ready for UC1, UC2, UC3 and UC5
else empty, not a number or negative (8a)
  POS --> Cashier : amount rejected; asks for it again
end
deactivate POS

... The Cashier works in the session (UC1, UC2, UC3, UC5) ...

== Close the session (section 3.2.4.1, steps 1-6) ==
Cashier -> POS : closeSession()
activate POS
alt no sale, return or rental is open
  POS --> Cashier : cash drawer opened for the closing count
else a sale, return or rental is still open (2a)
  POS --> Cashier : refused; finish or cancel it first
end
deactivate POS
Cashier -> POS : enterClosingCash(amount)
activate POS
POS --> Cashier : expected cash and difference with the closing cash
deactivate POS
note right of POS
  Expected cash = opening cash + cash payments - cash refunds of the session.
  An amount that is not valid is rejected (3a).
end note
Cashier -> POS : confirmCloseSession()
activate POS
alt difference up to 5.00 (4a)
  POS --> Cashier : session closed; login screen
else difference larger than 5.00 (4b, BR-17)
  POS --> Cashier : warning; session closed and marked "to review" by the store manager; login screen
end
deactivate POS

note over Cashier, POS
  After a failure the POS ends the interrupted session at the next start-up (end time = restart time,
  marked interrupted, no closing cash) and the Cashier logs in again (*a, FR-63).
end note
@enduml
